利用 PASS软件分析心内科门诊处方药物相互作用
赖伟华，廖广仁，罗宇芬（广东省人民医院，广东广州 510080）[摘要] 目的了解门诊处方中出现的药物相互作用情况，评估 PASS系统的性能。方法随机抽取心内科门诊处方2152份，利用PASS系统药物相互作用审查功能对其进行回顾性分析。结果共有 637 份处方出现1258次药物相互作用，其中严重者有 136 次，中度有 930 次，轻微有 192 次；发生相互作用的比例与处方药物品种数呈正相关。结论门诊合理用药水平有待提高，PASS能有效监测药物不良相互作用。A study on the analysis of dr ug inter action in pr escr iptions of car diac clinic by PASS LAI Wei - hua，LIAO Guang - ren，LUO Yu - fen. (Guangdong Provincial People′s Hospital, Guangzhou 510080, China)Abstr act: Objective To investigate and analyze the drug interaction in prescription and evaluate the efficiency of PASS in our hospital. Methods Prescriptions of cardiac clinic were randomly sampled and retrospectively analyzed by PASS. Results 1258 times drug interaction appeared in 637 prescriptions, including 136 in serious, 930 in moderate and 192 in mild;
